{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892130/extras/c51984a18963d0fbeddfa6176f614ccd.avif?t=1772736220\" width=616 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready for the fury!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage of the Dragons brings back the adrenaline of 2D battles with refined gameplay, charismatic characters and a dual combat system that demands strategy and precision. In this game, every blow counts and every decision can be the difference between victory and defeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage of the Dragons NEO is a PC version of Rage of the Dragons, released in 2002 for arcades. It was a unique and innovative game, mainly due to its highly praised visuals and technical aspects at the time. With beautiful scenery and animations, incredible moves and an acclaimed soundtrack, it's a must-have for any fighting game lover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous for being very challenging, Rage of the Dragons NEO is based on tag team battles where the player uses two characters, controlling one at a time, being able to alternate them during combat, and being able to use both at the same time to perform unique special moves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rage of the Dragons NEO features:</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual combat system:</strong> choose two fighters and switch between them in real time, creating devastating tricks and combos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic characters:</strong> Meet a gallery of fighters with unique styles, each with their own story and abilities ranging from the traditional to the supernatural. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic arcade mode:</strong> Relive the golden days of fighting games with arcade mode, taking on a series of opponents in pursuit of the title of champion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>And more:</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Challenge - new exclusive mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked or casual matches </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby for up to 8 players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay with take over </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All online modes with netcode rollback </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukebox - choose the music to play in the menus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 team combinations in classic mode</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First of many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892130/9f815df0aef8b66ba2a1db77ed2d94a4ba2bdf28.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892130/cf8d0d89fd8e854e6382197f20de33a450e338bb.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Loving it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892130/9c2f9a5f9be68e06ebc74b77f4c6547399a7807c.jpg"},{"name":"Too easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892130/d3468d844a397987111703fb2018f22ce56a0081.jpg"},{"name":"Just a regular day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892130/897ccf363337e8c2d7b97fb79bb79afb604f4b8c.jpg"},{"name":"Barely made it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892130/c2b3d0c053e09505698f5cf8b2129d5cfd7208b7.jpg"},{"name":"The Tale of Two Brothers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap